# ======================================================================
# Phase 0: Run ALL G1-G10 with detection only (RESO OFF)
# Use this to verify that detection works correctly for each geometry.
# Each scenario runs with test_ASAS_config_noreso.scn
# ======================================================================
# NOTE: You must run each scenario individually (BlueSky runs one at a time).
#       This file is a reference checklist — copy/paste each line into the
#       BlueSky command line, or create batch scripts.
#
# Phase 0 checklist:
#   SCEN Nils/asas_nat/test_G1_same_dir_same_FL
#   SCEN Nils/asas_nat/test_G2_same_dir_climbing
#   SCEN Nils/asas_nat/test_G3_parallel_same_FL
#   SCEN Nils/asas_nat/test_G4_parallel_climbing
#   SCEN Nils/asas_nat/test_G5_head_on_same_FL
#   SCEN Nils/asas_nat/test_G6_head_on_offset
#   SCEN Nils/asas_nat/test_G7_crossing_shallow
#   SCEN Nils/asas_nat/test_G8_crossing_MMO
#   SCEN Nils/asas_nat/test_G9_near_ceiling
#   SCEN Nils/asas_nat/test_G10_multi_aircraft
#
# For Phase 0 (no resolution): edit each test_G*.scn and change:
#   CALL test_ASAS_config_vert.scn  →  CALL test_ASAS_config_noreso.scn
#
# For Phase 1 (vertical MVP): use the scenarios as-is (they call _vert).
